# ML01 algorithms to sweep (one per line; lines starting with # are ignored).
# Full algorithm names (ML01.<algo>) — collect.py splits on the first dot.
# Source of truth: the algo_meta in each strategy file (§8); `zig build manifests`
# prints the registered roster.
# Halide algorithms need `uv sync`; collect.py skips any algorithm
# whose build fails, so a missing venv degrades gracefully (the Zig algorithms
# still run).
# Parallel algorithms (algos containing -par / rmerge) are auto-swept across
# THREADS (default {1,4,10}) by collect.py; serial algorithms run T=1 only.

# --- AF01 (math+decide+respawn | render) ---
ML01.AF01.LP1-autovec.LP2-simple
ML01.AF01.LP1-autovec.LP2-opt
ML01.AF01.LP1-scalar.LP2-simple
ML01.AF01.LP1-unroll.LP2-simple
ML01.AF01.LP1-autovec-par.LP2-simple
ML01.AF01.LP1-blend.LP2-simple
ML01.AF01.LP1-blend-par.LP2-simple
ML01.AF01.LP1-halide.LP2-simple
ML01.AF01.LP1-halide.LP2-opt
ML01.AF01.LP1-halide-par.LP2-simple

# --- AF02 (math | decide+respawn | render) ---
ML01.AF02.LP1-autovec.LP2-simple
ML01.AF02.LP1-autovec-par.LP2-simple
ML01.AF02.LP1-halide.LP2-simple
ML01.AF02.LP1-halide-par.LP2-simple

# --- AF03 (math+decide→mask | scan+respawn | render) ---
ML01.AF03.LP1-autovec.LP2-simple
ML01.AF03.LP1-autovec-par.LP2-rmerge
ML01.AF03.LP1-halide.LP2-simple

# --- AF04 (math+decide→list | respawn-dead | render) ---
ML01.AF04.LP1-autovec.LP2-simple
ML01.AF04.LP1-autovec-par.LP2-rmerge

# --- AF05–AF08 (fused render; framebuffer-only golden) ---
ML01.AF05.LP1-fused
ML01.AF06.LP1-autovec.LP2-fused
ML01.AF07.LP1-autovec.LP2-fused
ML01.AF08.LP1-autovec.LP2-fused
